<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh pork loins mostly $1.00 higher; butts 1.00 lower; ribs steady; skinned hams 1.00 higher; seedless bellies 2.00 higher; lean trimmings generally steady.</p>
<p>Trading slow, with light to  moderate demand and light offerings. -  USDA</p>
